//api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T21:23:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T21:25:07Z","body":"One concern is that the section currently needs to display both the section title, the changes text (e.g. `(2 changes)`) when folded, the folding arrow, and now a checkbox. The horizontal space for the section should be decided by the user, so there would probably have to be a priority of which features to display if we add more text. It might be worth it to add a small `On` label like in the `EditorPropertyCheck`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807552407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2809634024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2809634024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2809634024,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nd5zo","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub