users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T14:07:38Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T14:08:17Z","body":"That was the case before. This PR does not modify visibility of properties.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2809709275/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810362037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2810362037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2810362037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ngri1","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T18:18:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T22:30:56Z","body":"This PR does not change the visibility of any property other than the `enabled` property (which it moves into the section header). That being said, a big use case would be to use the checkboxes on features that have variables that are only meaningful when the feature is active. If this PR is merged, I plan on writing a followup PR to make an **opt-in** `hint_string` value that would hide the properties in the group if the feature is not active. That change would reduce the amount of code as many of the use-cases of `_validate_property` are solely to change the editor visibility of properties. There would also probably have to be a clarification that it doesn't reset/modify any of the properties that it hides.\r\n\r\nEdit: These changes are included in #105623","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810362037/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818415758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2818415758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2818415758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n_ZyO","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T13:31:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T13:31:21Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818415758/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822926026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2822926026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2822926026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oQm7K","user":{"login":"Raftatul","id":80292778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjkyNzc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80292778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul","html_url":"https://github.com/Raftatul","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T02:50:54Z","updated_at":"2025-04-24T00:35:31Z","body":"Is this how it's supposed to be used in GDScript?\r\nUnless I misunderstood something, I think it should be handled automatically.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@export_group(\"Data Group\")\r\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE, \"\") var data_group_enabled: bool :\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\tdata_group_enabled = value\r\n\t\tnotify_property_list_changed()\r\n\t\t\r\n@export var content: String\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _validate_property(property: Dictionary):\r\n\tif property.name == \"content\" and not data_group_enabled:\r\n\t\tproperty.usage = PROPERTY_USAGE_NO_EDITOR\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822926026/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822928793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2822928793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2822928793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oQnmZ","user":{"login":"Raftatul","id":80292778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMjkyNzc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80292778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul","html_url":"https://github.com/Raftatul","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raftatul/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T02:53:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T02:53:32Z","body":"> This PR does not change the visibility of any property other than the `enabled` property (which it moves into the section header). That being said, a big use case would be to use the checkboxes on features that have variables that are only meaningful when the feature is active. If this PR is merged, I plan on writing a followup PR to make an **opt-in** `hint_string` value that would hide the properties in the group if the feature is not active. That change would reduce the amount of code as many of the use-cases of `_validate_property` are solely to change the editor visibility of properties. There would also probably have to be a clarification that it doesn't reset/modify any of the properties that it hides.\r\n\r\nAh, my bad. I didn't seen that comment.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822928793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886422331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2886422331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2886422331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sC087","user":{"login":"thottee","id":42456553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDU2NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42456553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee","html_url":"https://github.com/thottee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T11:13:32Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T11:15:07Z","body":"All credit to the creator, but sorry, I tested it and I don't like this feature.\r\nThe biggest problem is that buttons where you can only click on a small area make it difficult to have a smooth workflow.\r\nIt isn't easy to click on it, miss it, and in places where you need to use it often, it's simply frustrating.\r\nFrom a UX perspective, need to forget about all the possible things where you have to click tiny buttons. Especially in frequently used places.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886422331/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886424083","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-2886424083","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":2886424083,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sC1YT","user":{"login":"thottee","id":42456553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDU2NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42456553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee","html_url":"https://github.com/thottee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u