epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T11:25:45Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T11:25:45Z","body":"See #105623","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886448427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316223819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105272#issuecomment-3316223819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105272","id":3316223819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FqY9L","user":{"login":"inhalt120g","id":106015575,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGrVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106015575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g","html_url":"https://github.com/inhalt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T19:48:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T22:24:03Z","body":"> All credit to the creator, but sorry, I tested it and I don't like this feature.\r\nThe biggest problem is that buttons where you can only click on a small area make it difficult to have a smooth workflow.\r\nIt isn't easy to click on it, miss it, and in places where you need to use it often, it's simply frustrating.\r\nFrom a UX perspective, need to forget about all the possible things where you have to click tiny buttons. Especially in frequently used places.\r\n\r\nI agree with everything, in addition it is also not immediately obvious why is it that some properties in the Inspector show this needless button, while others have the \">\" (collapsable indicator, paired with info on number of changes if there are any, which is immediately understandable even if you see Godot first time in your life).\r\n\r\nFor example, in the case of GPUParticle2D:\r\n<img width=\"323\" height=\"42\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/deb4e7af-454f-420a-8a74-f1731eb1ee8c\" />\r\none could argue that both Trails and Process Material should have this checkbox (or better yet, just use the \">\" like everything else in Godot).\r\n\r\nYes I personally understand why is it that some parts do and some don't have the tickbox, no need to explain it, I'm just saying it doesn't look consistent if you don't already know what is the tickbox hiding which is bad UX imo.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316223819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]